      "level": 2,
      "content": "9.1 Madhya Pradesh Police Organization"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The Madhya Pradesh Police is the law enforcement agency of the state of Madhya Pradesh. It is organized under the Director General of Police (DGP) who is the head of the state police. The MP Police Act, 1961 and related regulations govern the functioning of the state police. The state police is organized at various levels from the state level down to the police station level.",
      "id": "il5kao0"
    },
